docs {
  # 07 - Reject Transfer Without Auth

  Kiem thu rao chan bao mat: Nguoi dung an danh (khong co Bearer token) co tinh gui yeu cau chuyen giao don hang qua Store API.
  He thong phai lap tuc tu choi voi HTTP 401 Unauthorized vi yeu cau chuyen don bat buoc phai xac dinh duoc Customer Actor ID.
}
